      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOLAR SPECTRUM (1) has a strong record this trip with 12 wins and nine placings from 30 starts. Scored by 2 lengths last time (16.70) in a Grade 4/5 over 300m at this track. Has the ability and should feature. RHYTHMIC ENERGY (5) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage second, beaten 2 lengths (21.94) at Ballarat in a Special conditions Veteran race over 390m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to be in this for a long way. WINKING WILLIE (7) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 2.25 lengths (19.77) at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. One of the main contenders. KAIRANGA STORM (2) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
